# Scratch files live in `.temp/`

Whatever an agent needs to download, cache or generate (PDFs, screenshots, preview harnesses,
one-off scripts) goes in `.temp/` at the repository root. The folder is gitignored, so nothing in
it can reach a commit.

- Create the folder on demand.
- Keep scratch artefacts out of the tracked tree.
- Delete the contents once they stop being useful.
